# Read by apps/web at build time - Next inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* into the bundle.
# Locally leave it unset: apps/proxy serves the API on the page's own origin.
# For a deployed build, set it in Catalyst Console -> Slate -> web -> environment
# variables, never in a committed file.

# The API AppSail's origin, no trailing slash: https://api-<id>.<dc>.catalystappsail.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN=
